Package: auto-company
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), git, jq, curl, python3
Recommends: nodejs, npm
Maintainer: Auto Company Maintainers <silasmintori@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mintoriakamoto/auto-company-v2
Description: Autonomous AI company runtime (auto-loop + dashboard)
 24/7 autonomous loop runtime that drives a Claude/Codex CLI engine
 through repeated work cycles, with consensus memory, circuit breaker,
 log rotation, and a systemd user daemon for Linux hosts.
 .
 Target platform: Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (amd64). The payload is installed
 under /opt/auto-company/share and instantiated into a per-user
 workspace with the auto-company CLI.
